Subject: [PATCH] CI S2, piece 4: spikes and spikes-linux move to full.yml, the
 FULL lane (Part of #4104)

full.yml (new): a trigger job (a green push run of CI on main, or a run by hand), the two spikes jobs moved from ci.yml with
the commit under test checked out, and full-gate (needs every job, if always(), fails on any that did not pass, a skipped one
included). ci.yml loses the jobs, their plan outputs, the JOBS entries and quality-gate's needs. The catalog marks spikes lane
full and names the trigger and full-gate; merge-rule.yml's main_green no longer waits on the spikes; the merge rule's exclusion
list gains Full. Tests first: FullWorkflowTests (the triggers, the trigger job's event table, the checkouts, the group, and
main_green naming only ci.yml jobs); the job lists the tests pin lose the spikes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
